{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S03、S08—S12 等较短段落里，主线话语和较长的感受描述同时出现时，仍容易让观众来不及消化；X 的短词在这些段落更容易快速扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的优势不只是信息更丰富，而是把人物叙事的关键转折放大加亮，让观众即使不逐字阅读，也能抓住舍不得、后悔、孤独、重新选择这一条心理主线。感受部分又把音乐中的节奏、音色、力度变化转化成具体的身体反应和心理体验，并通过适时出现，让音乐与人物处境产生对应。X 的短词确实更容易快速浏览，但不少词只是情绪标签或孤立意象，观众较难从中理解情绪为什么发生变化，以及前后段落之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aefc8aea-1ba2-4a8a-bd03-723384123b98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T065128241741Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:52:24.491433+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "689e6951ae52c67d5795aa789b8e69b2d736ec60927d961bf63289b283f594c2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 